T*
() Tj
T*
(- `k = size`) Tj
T*
(- `num_candidates = max\(size * 5, 100\)`) Tj
T*
(- `rank_window_size = 100`) Tj
T*
(- `rank_constant = 60`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Practical effect:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- captures semantic relevance even when terms do not overlap exactly) Tj
T*
(- can recover meaning-based matches keyword search misses) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
